# Kernel config answers for symbols the fairydust snapshot has but upstream's
# files/arm64-dotconfig does not, appended to it by gen.sh. Without these,
# `make oldconfig` stops for input mid-build. Drop a line once upstream answers
# the symbol itself -- gen.sh fails until you do.
#
# Same forms as a .config: "CONFIG_FOO=m" or "# CONFIG_FOO is not set".

# TI SN201202x: TPS6598x-variant USB PD controller on SPMI, Apple M3 and later.
# Irrelevant to M1/M2, but this repository serves those machines too.
